<symbol type="16" id="181" code="714" name=" Temporary construction or closed area"><description>Obvious temporary constructions like platforms for spectators and speaker, closed area for spectators, outside restaurant areas, etc. shall be represented in plan shape. A Temporary construction or closed area shall not be entered.
